de-landmark w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M11.119 2.205a2 2 0 0 1 1.762 0l7.84 3.846A.5.5 0 0 1 20.5 7h-17a.5.5 0 0 1-.22-.949z\"></path><path d=\"M14 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M18 18v-7\"></path><path d=\"M3 22h18\"></path><path d=\"M6 18v-7\"></path></svg> Gazette JH-SIC-2026-v2.4</span><button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-download w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg> Download Official PDF</button></div></div></nav><header class=\"relative py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto border-b border-slate-800/80\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-1/4 -z-10 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-600/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 text-indigo-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-3.5 h-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Regulatory Framework &amp; Protocols</div><h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-4\">State Innovation Governance &amp; IP Guidelines</h1><p class=\"text-lg text-slate-400 font-medium leading-relaxed\">Standard operating procedures, intellectual property division, milestone-based escrow release schedules, and ethical compliance standards for all participating entities.</p></div></header><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-16\"><section class=\"space-y-6\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scale w-6 h-6 text-indigo-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path><path d=\"m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7\"></path><path d=\"M7 21h10\"></path></svg> Core Policy Frameworks</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">1. Institutional &amp; Participant Eligibility</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed\">Clear qualifying criteria ensuring reputable, capable research and implementation standards across academic, corporate, and civil domains.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Higher Education Institutes:</strong> NAAC &#x27;A&#x27; grade or NIRF Top 200 state/central universities with certified incubation facilities.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Startups &amp; MSMEs:</strong> DPIIT-registered with active Udyam certificates in DeepTech, Agritech, or CleanTech.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Civil Society / NGOs:</strong> 3+ years active operational history with valid NITI Aayog DARPAN ID registration.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Independent Experts:</strong> Verified credentials from national bodies (ISRO, DRDO, CSIR, ICAR).</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scale w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v18\"></path><path d=\"m19 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7\"></path><path d=\"M3 7h1a17 17 0 0 0 8-2 17 17 0 0 0 8 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m5 8 3 8a5 5 0 0 1-6 0zV7\"></path><path d=\"M7 21h10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">2. IP Rights &amp; Technology Transfer</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed\">Balanced model protecting student researchers while incentivizing industry sponsorship and preserving sovereign public utility rights.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>60-20-20 Royalty Split:</strong> 60% directly to the inventing research team, 20% to University R&amp;D Cell, 20% to State Innovation Escrow.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Industry First Right:</strong> Funding partners enjoy 180-day exclusive first right of refusal for commercial patent exploitation.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Public Good License:</strong> State Government retains irrevocable, royalty-free non-commercial deployment license across public welfare.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-indigo-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Open Source Clause:</strong> Civic software algorithms default to permissive open-source licenses after 24 months.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-coins w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.744 17.736a6 6 0 1 1-7.48-7.48\"></path><path d=\"M15 6h1v4\"></path><path d=\"m6.134 14.768.866-.5 2 3.464\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">3. Grant Disbursement &amp; Escrow Rules</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed\">Milestone-locked financial disbursement to prevent project stalling and guarantee transparent utilization of state and CSR capital.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 p-3 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 mb-4 text-center\"><div class=\"border-r border-slate-800 pr-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-emerald-400 block\">Tranche 1</span><span class=\"text-lg font-black text-white\">30%</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 block\">DPR Approval</span></div><div class=\"border-r border-slate-800 pr-2\"><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 block\">Tranche 2</span><span class=\"text-lg font-black text-white\">40%</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 block\">Lab Prototype</span></div><div><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-indigo-400 block\">Tranche 3</span><span class=\"text-lg font-black text-white\">30%</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-400 block\">Field Validation</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Funds are held in state-supervised escrow accounts. Release requires dual cryptographic sign-off by the Principal Investigator and the District Technology Officer.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 p-6 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 text-rose-400 flex items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2\">4. Citizen Privacy &amp; Ethical Oversight</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4 leading-relaxed\">Uncompromising citizen privacy protections adhering to national data governance legislation and institutional review norms.</p><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-rose-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>DPDP Act 2023 Compliance:</strong> Zero collection of Aadhaar or raw PII during initial challenge reporting.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-rose-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Geo-Privacy Fuzzing:</strong> Exact GPS coordinates are automatically blurred to a 500m radius polygon in public feeds.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-rose-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Informed Consent:</strong> Field testing in tribal and rural areas requires village Gram Sabha council approval.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 text-rose-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span><strong>Whistleblower Immunity:</strong> Citizen reporters are legally shielded from retaliation under State Whistleblower protections.</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"space-y-6\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">Frequently Answered Queries (FAQ)</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Detailed legal, financial, and procedural answers for project stakeholders.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-colors\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-base leading-snug\">How are Intellectual Property (IP) rights divided when an industry partner funds 100% of the prototype?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-colors\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-base leading-snug\">What occurs if a field trial fails to satisfy the milestone benchmarks during Phase 2?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-colors\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-base leading-snug\">Can an independent researcher or retired scientist lead a project without formal university affiliation?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-colors\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-base leading-snug\">How does the platform ensure citizen anonymity and protect whistleblower data?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-colors\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-base leading-snug\">What tax exemptions apply to corporate entities providing prototype funding?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-colors\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-4 text-left flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-colors\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-white text-base leading-snug\">How are inter-departmental clearances (Forestry, Mining, Water Resources) expedited?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-950/60 to-slate-900 border border-indigo-800/40 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 relative overflow-hidden\">